--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Description:
libgstnvunixfd.so is the x86_64 GStreamer unixfd plugin used by DeepStream.
The vendored plugin sources are LGPL-2.1-only; see LICENSE.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Pre-requisites:
- GStreamer 1.0 development packages
- CUDA Runtime
- x86_64 (this Makefile does not build on other architectures)

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Compiling and installing the library:

  $ export CUDA_VER=13.2 # x86_64 only
  $ make && sudo -E make install

Skip sudo when already root (for example inside a container).

The library libgstnvunixfd.so is installed at
/opt/nvidia/deepstream/deepstream/lib/gst-plugins/
